  "solution": "Given equation: 15 – 14 ÷ 21 × 27 + 9 = 64\n\nAfter interchanging the signs, we get:\n\n1. + and ÷\n\n15 – 14 + 21 × __**27 ÷ 9**__ = 64\n\n⇒ 15 – 14 + __**21 × 3**__ = 64\n\n⇒ __**15**__ – 14 __**+ 63**__ = 64\n\n⇒ __**78 - 14**__ = 64\n\n⇒ 64 = 64\n\n2. × and ÷\n\n15",
